WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.701
Watch and read: Ama asks: Which correctly writes a day and a Ghanaian place?

00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:10.632
The answer is: Monday and Accra. Days and names of places use capital initials.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:16.018
Watch and read: For your capitals practice, which spelling correctly writes the name

00:00:16.018 --> 00:00:17.423
of a person: ama?

00:00:18.283 --> 00:00:22.422
The answer is: Ama. Names of people begin with capital letters.
